      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "To check if all the necessary CPU facilities are installed on the subject machine, please run the test using a copy of the pypy source code",
      "source_hash": 15629479663610909378,
      "context_hash": 14213929280954787257,
      "translation": "대상 머신에 필요한 CPU 기능이 모두 설치되어 있는지 확인하려면 PyPy 소스 코드 사본을 사용하여 테스트를 실행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:56:30.669130Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "In addition you can run the auto encoding test to check if your Linux GCC tool chain is able to compile all instructions used in the JIT backend",
      "source_hash": 14754990290187154290,
      "context_hash": 14472068830004933084,
      "translation": "또한 자동 인코딩 테스트를 실행하여 Linux GCC 툴체인이 JIT 백엔드에서 사용되는 모든 명령어를 컴파일할 수 있는지 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:56:30.669470Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Translating",
      "source_hash": 9157747612007210167,
      "context_hash": 15270708129244230022,
      "translation": "변환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:56:35.691365Z",
      "issues": [
        "\"변환\" (conversion) conveys PyPy's RPython-to-C translation, but \"번역\" would better keep the project's term of art (\"translation toolchain\") consistent across the docs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Specifically check for these two dependencies.",
      "source_hash": 10184758654130323582,
      "context_hash": 8067567823664028469,
      "translation": "특히 이 두 가지 의존성을 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:56:43.985891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "On old versions of some Linux distributions ship older versions.",
      "source_hash": 11752317791900961185,
      "context_hash": 16531640545026820404,
      "translation": "일부 Linux 배포판의 구버전에는 이보다 오래된 버전이 포함되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
